# cyto genome exported from cell 4 — load it via Load Genome (rename to cyto-brush.gene).
Break gg : Biomass < 4000 : Convert gg @15
Light : gg < 10000 : FormBond g g
Break gg : rg < r & rg < 1000 : FormBond r b @10
Break rb : r < rb & r < 1000 : FormBond r g @10
Break rg : rb < rg & rb < 1000 : Contract @6
